WEBVTT

00:00:11.580 --> 00:00:17.290
Charce. Tell us everything.
Why do you have this mission?

00:00:17.290 --> 00:00:20.540
Who are you?

00:00:20.540 --> 00:00:22.870
I'm also a clone.

00:00:22.870 --> 00:00:25.910
My original is Noah Vix.

00:00:25.910 --> 00:00:28.910
The ruler of the Vixia Royal Quarter.

00:00:28.910 --> 00:00:30.910
I am a clone of the king.

00:02:03.200 --> 00:02:05.620
My oldest memories are full of stone columns...

00:02:05.620 --> 00:02:12.540
They were like a forest made of stone,
lined up in complex rows.

00:02:17.160 --> 00:02:19.000
Charce.

00:02:19.000 --> 00:02:24.200
Describe your mission.
For what purpose were you born?

00:02:24.200 --> 00:02:25.750
Yes.

00:02:25.750 --> 00:02:28.700
To become your body, my king.

00:02:28.700 --> 00:02:33.790
"Noah Vix
King of Vixia"
Yes. You belong to me--you are not a person.

00:02:33.790 --> 00:02:38.620
When the day comes,
you will surrender your life to me.

00:02:38.620 --> 00:02:40.250
As you wish...

00:02:41.580 --> 00:02:44.370
I was told that mission over
and over as I grew up.

00:02:44.370 --> 00:02:47.950
I led my life under a false identity,
as the son of a close aide to the king.

00:02:47.950 --> 00:02:51.200
I was not permitted to leave the castle.

00:02:51.200 --> 00:02:55.200
I was allowed to get information
about the outside world, though.

00:02:55.200 --> 00:02:59.200
So to pass the time, I studied voraciously.

00:02:59.200 --> 00:03:03.370
What I found most interesting
were plants and animals.

00:03:03.370 --> 00:03:08.660
Because I was locked in the castle,
biology was full of wonder.

00:03:10.200 --> 00:03:13.700
The princess, who knew about this,
looked after me,

00:03:13.700 --> 00:03:17.660
and we studied insects and plants
inside the castle grounds together.

00:03:17.660 --> 00:03:22.370
I loved spending time with her,
and that was the only "fun" I knew.

00:03:22.370 --> 00:03:26.870
I thought that was all the world had to offer,
and I was fine with that.

00:03:26.870 --> 00:03:28.830
But that day, when I turned 17...

00:03:29.450 --> 00:03:32.750
Perish with honor, Charce.

00:03:32.750 --> 00:03:39.450
When the Genome Control Act passed,
the king decided to kill the clone.

00:03:39.450 --> 00:03:42.660
Employ this, passed on in secret in Vixia.

00:03:42.660 --> 00:03:47.410
You will exit on Earth.
There is no way you will be found.

00:03:47.410 --> 00:03:50.160
Your transfer into the high school
has been arranged.

00:03:50.160 --> 00:03:55.000
For the remaining few days of your life,
I permit you to make friends.

00:03:55.000 --> 00:03:57.750
Perish with your companions.

00:04:00.370 --> 00:04:03.080
My life existed for the king.

00:04:03.080 --> 00:04:06.250
As a vessel, I was not permitted
to have a goal in life.

00:04:06.250 --> 00:04:11.620
I had no doubts about that,
since that's how I was raised.

00:04:15.660 --> 00:04:17.660
That's...

00:04:17.660 --> 00:04:19.700
That can't be...

00:04:19.700 --> 00:04:27.040
The king's orders are absolute.
I became the assassin to kill all of us.

00:04:27.040 --> 00:04:30.870
So the story about you
being raised as a noble...

00:04:34.700 --> 00:04:38.750
Not bad for something I improvised
on the spot, right?

00:04:38.750 --> 00:04:42.410
I don't understand! Why would you...?!

00:04:42.410 --> 00:04:44.120
Charce...

00:04:44.120 --> 00:04:46.250
Do you pity me?

00:04:46.250 --> 00:04:49.040
Don't force your values on me.

00:04:49.040 --> 00:04:51.540
You just don't understand.

00:04:51.540 --> 00:04:56.790
I'm willing to die for the king.
That is what I find to be fortunate.

00:04:56.790 --> 00:05:00.290
You must understand, Polina.
You know how people were in the old era.

00:05:00.290 --> 00:05:01.580
Yes.

00:05:02.660 --> 00:05:06.370
There were people in my era
who would gladly give their lives

00:05:06.370 --> 00:05:08.870
in support of the thing that they worshipped.

00:05:08.870 --> 00:05:14.290
Tangled relations engulfed the whole world,
dragging everything into chaos.

00:05:14.290 --> 00:05:16.410
That was just how things were at the time.

00:05:16.410 --> 00:05:18.790
Who can blame them?

00:05:18.790 --> 00:05:22.660
They became that way because
they were raised that way.

00:05:22.660 --> 00:05:27.160
There are so many people living
their lives today with no purpose.

00:05:27.160 --> 00:05:29.660
I, however, can say with pride

00:05:29.660 --> 00:05:32.700
what a wonderful life I have!

00:05:39.370 --> 00:05:41.830
So are you saying it was all an act?

00:05:41.830 --> 00:05:43.250
Yes.

00:05:43.250 --> 00:05:47.700
You're lying. You really think
we are your companions.

00:05:47.700 --> 00:05:49.330
Stand back.

00:05:49.330 --> 00:05:51.660
Don't underestimate me.

00:05:51.660 --> 00:05:55.250
I can tell when someone's
expressions are forced.

00:05:55.250 --> 00:05:57.540
You really love us.

00:05:57.540 --> 00:06:00.000
You give yourselves too much credit.

00:06:00.000 --> 00:06:02.750
How else would we have made it this far?

00:06:04.500 --> 00:06:08.950
We had each other's backs,
clawing desperately to make it home...

00:06:08.950 --> 00:06:11.620
You'll never convince me that we aren't friends!

00:06:14.830 --> 00:06:18.540
No! I have no friends!

00:06:18.540 --> 00:06:20.660
Then why?

00:06:20.660 --> 00:06:23.000
Why did you retract the sphere, twice?

00:06:25.620 --> 00:06:29.580
On Vilavurs, and here on this planet,

00:06:29.580 --> 00:06:34.290
you had the chance to, but you stopped.

00:06:34.290 --> 00:06:36.750
You could have chased me down
and killed me then.

00:06:38.370 --> 00:06:40.540
You hesitated, you didn't want to kill him!

00:06:40.540 --> 00:06:45.200
No. I have no hesitations
to execute the mission.

00:06:45.200 --> 00:06:47.540
The reason I stopped was...

00:06:49.700 --> 00:06:51.700
...to prevent Aries from getting taken with you.

00:06:53.790 --> 00:06:55.450
Aries?

00:06:55.450 --> 00:07:01.910
You have one misunderstanding.
My aim isn't to return to Astra alone.

00:07:01.910 --> 00:07:07.620
My original goal was to kill everyone,
but I changed those plans.

00:07:07.620 --> 00:07:11.410
That's because I found Aries.

00:07:11.410 --> 00:07:13.200
What are you saying?

00:07:14.790 --> 00:07:19.160
The moment I saw you at the spaceport,
I saw the resemblance.

00:07:19.160 --> 00:07:24.870
Then, I learned about your photographic
memory in the forests of Vilavurs.

00:07:24.870 --> 00:07:28.830
And then, about your different-colored eyes.

00:07:28.830 --> 00:07:33.290
I was convinced. You have the same genes.

00:07:33.290 --> 00:07:36.000
Aries, you are the king's only daughter.

00:07:42.160 --> 00:07:44.660
A clone of Princess Seira.

00:07:47.750 --> 00:07:49.000
Charce.

00:07:49.000 --> 00:07:50.330
Charce, wait.

00:07:50.330 --> 00:07:53.700
Oh, my apologies, your highness.

00:07:53.700 --> 00:07:56.580
Come on, I told you, just call me Seira.

00:07:57.620 --> 00:08:02.580
You're my personal aide now.
Just obey what I say.

00:08:02.580 --> 00:08:05.040
Yes... Seira.

00:08:05.040 --> 00:08:10.040
This is funny. Genetically, I'm your daughter.

00:08:10.040 --> 00:08:13.580
But to me, you feel like a little brother.

00:08:13.580 --> 00:08:17.660
Seira, why are you so kind to me?

00:08:17.660 --> 00:08:19.790
I'm just a clone--

00:08:19.790 --> 00:08:23.200
Charce, I don't care how my father sees you.

00:08:23.200 --> 00:08:30.580
As I've said many times, I'm opposed
to my father's rejuvenation plan.

00:08:30.580 --> 00:08:33.950
Clones are people too... I can't forgive him.

00:08:35.700 --> 00:08:39.410
I actually had a clone, too.

00:08:39.410 --> 00:08:41.580
A clone? Like me?

00:08:41.580 --> 00:08:42.660
Yes.

00:08:43.700 --> 00:08:49.500
When they told me about the plan,
I resisted their attempt to clone me.

00:08:49.500 --> 00:08:53.700
But they acquired my cells
without my knowledge.

00:08:55.910 --> 00:08:58.620
Father! How could you?!

00:08:58.620 --> 00:09:04.700
Your clone and mine... They will be
raised by their surrogate mothers.

00:09:04.700 --> 00:09:11.830
A spare, just in case. If you were to fall
gravely ill, we could use her organs.

00:09:11.830 --> 00:09:13.250
No! I refuse!

00:09:13.250 --> 00:09:17.000
Remember your mother and how
she died of that illness.

00:09:17.000 --> 00:09:22.870
I don't want to lose anyone again.
Please understand, Seira.

00:09:22.870 --> 00:09:25.290
Together, we shall live forever.

00:09:30.750 --> 00:09:33.410
Her highness awaits. This way.

00:09:33.410 --> 00:09:34.790
Ms. Emma.

00:09:36.700 --> 00:09:38.540
Emma!

00:09:38.540 --> 00:09:39.750
Your highness!

00:09:39.750 --> 00:09:44.700
Thank you for making the decision
to leave Vixia with this child.

00:09:44.700 --> 00:09:47.580
Your escape is ready, please hurry.

00:09:47.580 --> 00:09:50.450
Emma, tell me again.

00:09:50.450 --> 00:09:53.500
Are you ready to become this child's mother?

00:09:53.500 --> 00:09:55.870
Yes, I am.

00:09:55.870 --> 00:10:00.910
She is not my flesh and blood, but I
raised her as a surrogate in my body...

00:10:00.910 --> 00:10:07.000
I cannot bear to raise her here,
knowing how terrible her fate is.

00:10:07.000 --> 00:10:08.250
Thank you.

00:10:08.250 --> 00:10:13.200
Emma, I'm sorry. You're the only person
I can trust with this.

00:10:13.200 --> 00:10:17.080
I will raise her with care.

00:10:17.080 --> 00:10:18.660
We must depart.

00:10:20.080 --> 00:10:21.950
Please, wipe your tears.

00:10:21.950 --> 00:10:22.950
Yes.

00:10:24.000 --> 00:10:28.830
Your highness, the child does not
have a name. Please name her.

00:10:28.830 --> 00:10:30.330
A name...

00:10:33.830 --> 00:10:35.160
"Aries."

00:10:35.160 --> 00:10:40.040
Aries... That is a wonderful name.

00:10:40.040 --> 00:10:43.080
My daughter, Aries...

00:10:48.410 --> 00:10:50.080
Aries...

00:10:50.080 --> 00:10:51.620
Live well...

00:10:53.040 --> 00:10:57.290
I told father that the baby died suddenly.

00:10:57.290 --> 00:11:03.910
He tried to force me to create another clone,
but I continued to defy him.

00:11:07.660 --> 00:11:12.290
But I am powerless to stop
my father's ambitions. I'm sorry.

00:11:12.290 --> 00:11:15.700
Oh Charce, what a terrible fate you have...

00:11:15.700 --> 00:11:17.750
What's so terrible?

00:11:17.750 --> 00:11:22.830
The fact that you don't understand--
that's what pains me the most.

00:11:22.830 --> 00:11:28.620
Seira was a strong, gentle, and noble soul.

00:11:33.500 --> 00:11:36.040
"Vixia Royal Quarter
One year before camp"

00:11:36.290 --> 00:11:39.540
Though my only purpose in life
was to become the king's vessel,

00:11:39.540 --> 00:11:43.830
I made it my secret personal mission
to protect and entertain her.

00:11:43.830 --> 00:11:46.700
Look at this tree. It's grown bigger again.

00:11:46.700 --> 00:11:49.830
Oh, I see...

00:11:49.830 --> 00:11:53.160
Hey, a white-eye!
Didn't we see him the other day?

00:11:53.160 --> 00:11:55.500
Oh, wow...

00:11:55.500 --> 00:11:57.040
You're boring.

00:11:57.040 --> 00:12:01.910
I don't remember. I don't have your memory.

00:12:01.910 --> 00:12:06.410
But look over here, there's a worm
being carried by an army of ants.

00:12:06.410 --> 00:12:08.580
I'm going to check out the flowers over there.

00:12:37.500 --> 00:12:39.580
Seira!

00:12:41.500 --> 00:12:46.370
An assassination, made to look like
an accident. But there was no proof.

00:12:46.370 --> 00:12:50.620
Witness testimony from a single aide
was quickly brushed under the rug.

00:12:55.540 --> 00:13:01.370
Though you deserve to be sentenced to death,
your body belongs to me.

00:13:01.370 --> 00:13:04.450
You will spend the rest of your days here.
Repent your sins.

00:13:09.000 --> 00:13:12.410
I was left alone for a long time.

00:13:12.410 --> 00:13:15.870
I spent the time staring at the wall.

00:13:15.870 --> 00:13:24.120
I kept thinking about who I am, and regret
drove me to understand I have no value.

00:13:24.950 --> 00:13:27.540
"Vixia Royal Quarter
One week before camp"

00:13:27.790 --> 00:13:29.540
Charce.

00:13:29.540 --> 00:13:35.750
The laws of the land have been changed,
before your time to sacrifice your body.

00:13:35.750 --> 00:13:38.040
Now you must die.

00:13:39.540 --> 00:13:43.620
Oh, now I can finally fulfill my mission...

00:13:43.620 --> 00:13:46.410
Now I can finally put this life to use!

00:13:47.790 --> 00:13:49.500
Yes!

00:13:49.500 --> 00:13:51.080
As you wish!

00:13:55.040 --> 00:13:59.950
There's no doubt about it--you are
the clone of Princess Seira.

00:13:59.950 --> 00:14:03.290
You were smuggled out of Vixia
when you were a baby.

00:14:03.290 --> 00:14:06.540
So, my mother is...

00:14:06.540 --> 00:14:09.580
One of Seira's handmaids.

00:14:09.580 --> 00:14:11.620
Not your biological mother.

00:14:13.040 --> 00:14:14.870
Well.

00:14:14.870 --> 00:14:18.910
Mother's Day? For me?

00:14:18.910 --> 00:14:20.580
Thank you.

00:14:22.160 --> 00:14:24.000
Please?

00:14:24.000 --> 00:14:30.120
What? No, if there's something you want,
you have to wait until your birthday.

00:14:33.410 --> 00:14:36.000
Happy birthday!

00:14:36.000 --> 00:14:38.870
Here is your present.

00:14:47.790 --> 00:14:51.950
Mom! Mom!

00:14:53.580 --> 00:14:59.910
If Aries's whereabouts were kept a secret,
how did she get onto this team?

00:14:59.910 --> 00:15:03.870
Probably orchestrated by the faction
who assassinated Seira.

00:15:03.870 --> 00:15:09.580
They found out about Emma and
made it so Aries got on team B5.

00:15:09.580 --> 00:15:13.040
If the Genome Control Act reveals
she's the princess's clone,

00:15:13.040 --> 00:15:16.040
she might become the king's heir.

00:15:16.040 --> 00:15:20.410
That's why they tried to have her killed...

00:15:20.410 --> 00:15:25.120
I won't let them. I won't let Aries die...

00:15:25.120 --> 00:15:30.910
Seira's life, that was taken from us,
is back again.

00:15:30.910 --> 00:15:34.870
Oh, I can see the tears of joy
flowing down the king's face.

00:15:34.870 --> 00:15:40.330
Aries will return as Princess Seira!
I will take her back!

00:15:40.330 --> 00:15:43.450
I've had... enough!

00:15:43.450 --> 00:15:46.370
Aries is Aries! Not Seira!

00:15:46.370 --> 00:15:47.620
You idiot!

00:15:49.000 --> 00:15:53.700
You don't understand how much the king...

00:15:53.700 --> 00:15:55.040
Shut up!

00:15:55.040 --> 00:15:59.080
Shut up about the king!
You're the one who's sad!

00:15:59.080 --> 00:16:04.040
Who mourned the princess's death the most?
Who was happy to find Aries the most?

00:16:04.040 --> 00:16:05.620
It's you!

00:16:09.450 --> 00:16:12.040
What happens after you take Aries back?

00:16:12.040 --> 00:16:19.410
Wouldn't you be killed anyway,
since you're still the king's clone?

00:16:21.620 --> 00:16:27.620
I would... go back out to space and die alone.

00:16:31.370 --> 00:16:32.660
Kanata?!

00:16:32.660 --> 00:16:35.500
Is that what you really want?!

00:16:35.500 --> 00:16:38.040
Don't lie to your friends, you idiot!

00:16:41.200 --> 00:16:44.910
Now I know why you were having
so much fun on this trip.

00:16:44.910 --> 00:16:46.700
You were happier than anybody else

00:16:46.700 --> 00:16:50.410
that you got out of your castle
and saw the world.

00:16:51.830 --> 00:16:54.580
My dream came true.

00:16:54.580 --> 00:16:57.660
What you really want is to live.

00:16:57.660 --> 00:17:02.540
Let's go home together. We can see more
of what the world has to offer.

00:17:02.540 --> 00:17:08.250
After all, none of us know
our own planet very well.

00:17:09.950 --> 00:17:12.120
Let's go home together, Charce!

00:17:12.120 --> 00:17:13.410
Charce!

00:17:13.410 --> 00:17:15.040
Let's go home!

00:17:15.040 --> 00:17:17.790
The originals are the ones
who are going to get punished.

00:17:17.790 --> 00:17:21.750
King or not, a crime is a crime.
There's no reason why you should die.

00:17:21.750 --> 00:17:28.500
How you were born or raised was not your choice.
But you can change from here on.

00:17:28.500 --> 00:17:30.410
I can't change.

00:17:30.410 --> 00:17:32.410
That's how it was where I was raised.

00:17:32.410 --> 00:17:34.040
You can change!

00:17:34.040 --> 00:17:37.330
Look at me! I've changed!

00:17:37.330 --> 00:17:39.250
Thanks to all of you!

00:17:41.250 --> 00:17:44.620
I'm also no longer the person my mom raised.

00:17:44.620 --> 00:17:46.450
I'm different from Funi, too.

00:17:46.450 --> 00:17:49.120
This has nothing to do
with your parents or your genes.

00:17:49.120 --> 00:17:54.450
Who you meet, how you live, those things
can change you however you like!

00:17:58.500 --> 00:18:03.040
I know that. It's clear.

00:18:03.040 --> 00:18:06.750
I was part of this trip, too.

00:18:06.750 --> 00:18:09.370
But I...

00:18:12.450 --> 00:18:16.660
There's nothing I can do...

00:18:41.950 --> 00:18:46.910
I hid the sphere generation device
in the left sleeve of my suit

00:18:46.910 --> 00:18:50.080
so that I could bring it out whenever I needed.

00:18:55.500 --> 00:18:57.950
I have another one in my right sleeve.

00:18:57.950 --> 00:18:59.660
Back up, everyone!

00:19:02.950 --> 00:19:04.910
Charce...

00:19:06.040 --> 00:19:06.910
Dammit!

00:19:06.910 --> 00:19:09.370
Ulgar, you don't have a shot from here!

00:19:09.370 --> 00:19:13.790
It's okay. He won't hurt us,
not while Aries is on this side.

00:19:13.790 --> 00:19:16.040
Then why did he...

00:19:17.910 --> 00:19:24.950
I know, Charce. I know what you're thinking.
We're companions, after all.

00:19:27.370 --> 00:19:28.910
The sphere...

00:19:30.120 --> 00:19:33.370
Charce is trying to kill himself!

00:19:35.620 --> 00:19:38.540
Charce!

00:19:39.410 --> 00:19:43.540
I'm sorry, everyone. I really love you.

00:19:44.950 --> 00:19:45.830
Kanata!

00:19:45.830 --> 00:19:47.120
Stop, Kanata!

00:19:47.910 --> 00:19:49.160
Kanata?!

00:19:49.160 --> 00:19:50.330
Kanata!

00:19:50.330 --> 00:19:52.620
Is he going around the sphere?
He's not going to be fast enough!

00:19:52.620 --> 00:19:54.370
No...

00:19:54.370 --> 00:19:56.580
He's running straight into it!

00:20:01.000 --> 00:20:03.910
Yes, Kanata.

00:20:03.910 --> 00:20:07.040
You're always running.

00:20:07.040 --> 00:20:09.040
Straight on.

00:20:09.040 --> 00:20:10.330
No hesitation.

00:20:13.080 --> 00:20:17.040
From the day we first met.

00:20:29.580 --> 00:20:32.120
Anti-gravity shoes!

00:20:32.120 --> 00:20:34.290
Ultimate Dive Bomb!

00:20:38.290 --> 00:20:40.200
Charce!

00:20:40.200 --> 00:20:42.160
Kanata!

00:20:42.160 --> 00:20:43.950
Hurry, run!

00:20:45.830 --> 00:20:49.450
Get away from us, or else!

00:21:04.700 --> 00:21:05.870
Kanata...!

00:21:05.870 --> 00:21:07.330
Kanata!

00:21:11.580 --> 00:21:14.120
Hold him down! I'll stop the bleeding!

00:21:14.120 --> 00:21:16.370
My arm...!

00:21:29.080 --> 00:21:29.910
Kanata!

00:21:29.910 --> 00:21:31.790
--Kanata!
--I can't stop the bleeding!

00:21:31.790 --> 00:21:34.120
Zack! Bring up the controls
on Kanata's crust suit.

00:21:34.120 --> 00:21:35.950
Set pressure on the right arm to maximum!

00:21:35.950 --> 00:21:37.000
On it!

00:21:38.830 --> 00:21:42.790
I'm sorry! Kanata, I'm sorry!

00:21:44.700 --> 00:21:50.370
Hey... Once we get back to Astra,
you owe me big time.

00:21:50.370 --> 00:21:53.950
You have to help me, by my side.

00:21:53.950 --> 00:21:56.290
Kanata... I...

